<node id="Author-contribution footnote for 'Attention Is All You Need' (discarded)">
  <data key="d0">Author-contribution footnote for 'Attention Is All You Need' (discarded)</data>
  <data key="d1">discarded</data>
  <data key="d2">Author-contribution footnote attributing key ideas and engineering work: Jakob proposed replacing RNNs with self-attention; Noam proposed scaled dot-product and multi-head attention plus positional scheme; Ashish and Illia implemented initial Transformers; Niki, Llion, Lukasz, and Aidan contributed code, tensor2tensor, tuning, inference, and visualizations. Contains affiliation markers (∗, †, ‡) and provenance details.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b2db8dfdfda73b7fefce3d696163a80</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763834865</data>
