<node id="Transformer_model_architecture_Figure_1 (image)">
  <data key="d0">Transformer_model_architecture_Figure_1 (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">Schematic diagram of the Transformer encoder-decoder architecture: a left encoder stack (N=6) of multi-head self-attention and feed-forward sub-layers, and a right decoder stack (N=6) with masked self-attention, encoder-decoder attention, and feed-forward sub-layers. Embeddings are combined with positional encodings; encoder outputs feed into decoder attention; decoder produces outputs through a linear layer and softmax. The figure visualizes residual connections and Add &amp; Norm operations described in Sections 3 and 3.1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b14e849e78f85a617af47b45fd656499</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763834865</data>
</node>
