  <data key="d3">chunk-b1bed0ea6444324ec428530469a0502b</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763834865</data>
</node>
<node id="Transformer inverse-square-root learning-rate schedule with linear warmup (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Transformer inverse-square-root learning-rate schedule with linear warmup (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">A piecewise learning-rate schedule used to train Transformers: lrate = d_model^{-1/2} * min(step^{-1/2}, step * warmup_steps^{-3/2}). It linearly increases the rate during a warmup interval (preventing early instability), reaches a peak at step = warmup_steps, then decays as the inverse square root of step; scaled by d_model^{-1/2} to normalize across model sizes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b553f765177b573ddcca3e81efd2202</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763834865</data>
</node>
